 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_d9f24a72f3a814e00943",
   "sourceHash": "d9f24a72f3a814e009433da79bb50e2bd78e578846585404be6c49899f70ff8b",
   "text": "学员将学习精准施行 Abhyangam（阿比扬伽）、Shirodhara（希罗达拉）和潘查卡玛（Panchakarma）等疗法，确保治疗安全有效。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2fa7c6c097f89f1fd721",
   "sourceHash": "2fa7c6c097f89f1fd721fbb24b029167da79bf9ac82bd95f04739bab8c8926ad",
   "text": "建立信心",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_564811fd59119eae72d5",
   "sourceHash": "564811fd59119eae72d5f0eb57456072fae4c70257c7b87355078eb429467fa8",
   "text": "建立信心：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_acf871928abff522131f",
   "sourceHash": "acf871928abff522131f98850f2d644ac8beec995e4e34b0e3843d450c625158",
   "text": "实操经验与专家指导能增强从业者的信心，使其能够胜任处理各种健康状况。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_493e8a6a2fe9cc2608fc",
   "sourceHash": "493e8a6a2fe9cc2608fcbdc92695396bb579920fb18225338bef826465861f7f",
   "text": "理解整体照护",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_df69f622d29a45273d6a",
   "sourceHash": "df69f622d29a45273d6a5d25c9f28512105bd9efe76fe3b1c5eba5f37497c3bf",
   "text": "理解整体照护：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_350c8aeba8356479e96b",
   "sourceHash": "350c8aeba8356479e96b5cc376b79965a84cdda73ca6d6312ff525a31bb2fcfa",
   "text": "培训有助于学员更深入地领会阿育吠陀的整体理念，兼顾身、心、灵，实现全面健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3c07e5379544f7511a6e",
   "sourceHash": "3c07e5379544f7511a6e3f18eef835d92a74a24937d4d3ff12d525c639f8f685",
   "text": "致有志成为阿育吠陀专业人士的您",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e9e956f583d8398ac72",
   "sourceHash": "7e9e956f583d8398ac72c3718453b61f5bad0c5cbbec4d85e9c9cf3bf2dc5c8b",
   "text": "随着越来越多的人寻求自然、可持续的健康方案，全球对阿育吠陀的需求正快速增长。这种日益浓厚的兴趣为受过专业培训的人士带来了大量机会。对于有志在阿育吠陀领域发展事业的人来说，培训是精通这一领域不可或缺的一步。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c038cfc65a435949b4e7",
   "sourceHash": "c038cfc65a435949b4e739912bbec6a7723193f8932d8584dd65aca150586421",
   "text": "培训对专业人士为何至关重要：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b38d56248f0d89a53e2c",
   "sourceHash": "b38d56248f0d89a53e2c39b9f0f5e43d84bdab967d96c694ffe8cd9f6c3dae81",
   "text": "符合行业标准",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_529b297aa0469a4f560d",
   "sourceHash": "529b297aa0469a4f560d4f3007b7bbf798a414d2e427110b7b0fb8f15a562454",
   "text": "符合行业标准：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8af22ef73d2e497e8037",
   "sourceHash": "8af22ef73d2e497e80370018fc677e62dc46c97297ed72d2262c76b82359bf49",
   "text": "随着对合格阿育吠陀治疗师和从业者的需求不断增长，培训可确保从业者遵循最高的照护标准。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_56da2f06dc74a4f2314a",
   "sourceHash": "56da2f06dc74a4f2314a8df8cfdd966845a252cc5cfa3ed9a091ddd4a933b034",
   "text": "技术专精",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c8a27df9142b21c7b501",
   "sourceHash": "c8a27df9142b21c7b5015bb09a6b1ccf0007b57905c7e528e6cea6eb1156eb74",
   "text": "技术专精：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ca050996623b1107269b",
   "sourceHash": "ca050996623b1107269b5f4fbe55bf7e8d46673fb9adb2b10f4315ed863004f6",
   "text": "培训项目深入讲解阿育吠陀疗法的细节，提供应对复杂健康状况所需的专业知识。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f17498ea142c12022285",
   "sourceHash": "f17498ea142c120222850d06d7ff8ea5ae068a3683111d214aeba29d2c507a42",
   "text": "职业发展",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bd7bc6cff1e5946bc808",
   "sourceHash": "bd7bc6cff1e5946bc808a4ab1558dfabfcd21cd095943383edc3bb4780643618",
   "text": "职业发展：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c5b10d6714219c4710a5",
   "sourceHash": "c5b10d6714219c4710a5372d00d8dd357fe0c2fd347f83813b2af684e80edf20",
   "text": "扎实的阿育吠陀基础可拓宽职业前景，为您开启在全球各地康养中心、理疗机构及医疗保健机构任职的机会。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'spas' rendered as 理疗机构 (therapy centres) per language lock."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f9b44c3b177cd876f4d6",
   "sourceHash": "f9b44c3b177cd876f4d69abe37c649e0832bdcc4408c659cf9a6616849f373b7",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀培训的理想之选",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c72c5404cfcb01c1780b",
   "sourceHash": "c72c5404cfcb01c1780bcb362c18d37e90af3a33888dad0c1c13e53819ef885f",
   "text": "在",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_35d235cab394cccdac97",
   "sourceHash": "35d235cab394cccdac976c9d411b09b2390fcc491470f0cc4d2f934aa50907bb",
   "text": "，我们的培训项目经过精心设计，兼顾理论知识与实践经验。Kairali 坐落于阿育吠陀的发源地喀拉拉邦的宁静风光之中，提供沉浸式学习环境，让学员能够与这一古老传统建立深厚联结。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6863798c9fd09b442382",
   "sourceHash": "6863798c9fd09b442382447a0bb7d295aac42be9fc831d62afb35ce3f6ee495a",
   "text": "在 Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村，我们的培训项目经过精心设计，兼顾理论知识与实践经验。Kairali 坐落于阿育吠陀的发源地喀拉拉邦的宁静风光之中，提供沉浸式学习环境，让学员能够与这一古老传统建立深厚联结。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3e35771e19a2c3a96cb6",
   "sourceHash": "3e35771e19a2c3a96cb673a42a4d8759d1dde3348847fec486abc551f528848f",
   "text": "由经验丰富的阿育吠陀从业者提供专业指导。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_51fba598b0ca2344c13a",
   "sourceHash": "51fba598b0ca2344c13a41917157852a881149405b40e6c0c756432a13fd76e7",
   "text": "疗法与治疗的实操培训。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
